WEBVTT

01:26.130 --> 01:31.569
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.210 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 22: Water Ghost in the Canal]

01:44.350 --> 01:49.270
Low humidity! Beware of fire hazards!

01:52.840 --> 01:57.720
Low humidity! Beware of fire hazards!

02:08.800 --> 02:10.396
With the help of the Su family,

02:10.420 --> 02:11.346
things are bound to get better.

02:11.370 --> 02:12.820
Just be patient.

02:13.100 --> 02:14.770
I can't wait any longer!

02:14.870 --> 02:16.945
Mr. Mo is accused of stealing official silver.

02:16.969 --> 02:18.920
The government won't let him go easily.

02:19.440 --> 02:21.166
They're good at extorting confessions,

02:21.190 --> 02:22.870
and must have tortured him.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.616
He's not a martial artist.

02:24.640 --> 02:26.220
How can he stand it?

02:30.760 --> 02:32.636
The guards are changing off soon.

02:32.660 --> 02:33.956
It'll be the perfect chance.

02:33.980 --> 02:35.816
OK. Tell everyone

02:35.840 --> 02:36.816
to follow the plan.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.290
Wait.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.776
Mr. Mo is all I have.

02:41.800 --> 02:43.716
Kang Qiao, please listen to me.

02:43.740 --> 02:45.056
Just a few words,

02:45.080 --> 02:46.546
and if you still insist on breaking into the jail,

02:46.570 --> 02:48.020
I won't stop you.

02:49.200 --> 02:50.296
First,

02:50.320 --> 02:53.656
Mr. Mo and I are not people who strictly abide by the sect rules,

02:53.680 --> 02:55.450
but we do act within boundaries.

02:55.840 --> 02:59.710
It's never wise to offend the government.

03:00.410 --> 03:02.206
It will only be condemned by the sect.

03:02.230 --> 03:03.680
Second,

03:04.080 --> 03:06.176
are you really going to break in like that,

03:06.200 --> 03:07.900
with absolutely no cover-up?

03:07.950 --> 03:08.500
If so,

03:08.520 --> 03:10.896
you will only bring trouble upon the sect.

03:10.920 --> 03:12.370
Third,

03:12.730 --> 03:15.110
Guanghui Bank is practically

03:15.470 --> 03:17.540
Mr. Mo's life's work.

03:18.060 --> 03:19.846
If it is destroyed

03:19.870 --> 03:22.380
because of your impulsive act,

03:23.560 --> 03:25.320
and Mr. Mo is thus down and out

03:25.340 --> 03:26.796
for the rest of his life,

03:26.820 --> 03:28.306
maybe he won't blame you,

03:28.330 --> 03:30.426
but will you be able to forgive yourself?

03:30.450 --> 03:32.890
Losing Guanghui Bank is better than losing his life.

03:33.500 --> 03:35.600
I just want Mr. Mo to be alive.

03:43.790 --> 03:45.116
We need to make a decision now.

03:45.140 --> 03:47.470
It's the only good chance we'll have.

04:04.890 --> 04:06.340
Forget it.

04:08.540 --> 04:10.080
We'll wait one more day.

04:12.740 --> 04:14.710
I hope the Su family will do something.

04:21.340 --> 04:28.410
[Shao's Residence]

04:23.320 --> 04:26.530
Leave some leeway and speak only 70% of your mind.

04:26.790 --> 04:29.990
Leave some leeway and speak only 70% of your mind.

04:30.330 --> 04:33.380
Leave some leeway and speak only 70% of your mind.

04:33.910 --> 04:37.070
Leave some leeway and speak only 70% of your mind.

04:37.810 --> 04:39.260
Mr. Su.

04:39.670 --> 04:40.666
Advisor Xu.

04:40.690 --> 04:41.516
I'm sorry.

04:41.540 --> 04:44.476
I should call you Chairman Su now.

04:44.500 --> 04:45.556
I came here

04:45.580 --> 04:46.986
to inform you as soon as possible

04:47.010 --> 04:48.506
about the change of the chairman.

04:48.530 --> 04:50.256
It's indeed a bit too early.

04:50.280 --> 04:52.525
Please forgive me.

04:52.549 --> 04:53.646
The magistrate is up.

04:53.670 --> 04:55.736
Chairman Su, please come in.

04:55.760 --> 04:57.210
After you.

05:01.390 --> 05:02.816
Mr. Shao is very busy

05:02.840 --> 05:05.260
and has been reviewing documents here since he got up.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.726
If it weren't for the fact that you're such an important guest,

05:07.750 --> 05:09.806
he wouldn't have agreed to receive any visitor.

05:09.830 --> 05:11.116
Thank you, Mr. Xu,

05:11.140 --> 05:12.750
for passing the word for me.

05:13.530 --> 05:16.470
But there's one thing you should be aware of.

05:17.400 --> 05:18.556
Please go on.

05:18.580 --> 05:20.006
I'm all ears.

05:20.030 --> 05:21.956
Mo Bufan stole from the Treasury

05:21.980 --> 05:23.466
and refuses to plead guilty,

05:23.490 --> 05:24.856
which is making Mr. Shao very indignant

05:24.880 --> 05:26.206
and furious.

05:26.230 --> 05:27.830
Chairman Su, please make sure

05:27.970 --> 05:30.370
that you don't mention anything about it.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.610
OK.

05:36.320 --> 05:39.320
[Jingzhi Hall]

05:41.830 --> 05:43.566
My Lord, Chairman Su is here.

05:43.590 --> 05:45.040
Come in.

05:48.600 --> 05:50.860
Chairman Su, please.

05:51.420 --> 05:52.870
Thank you.

06:00.160 --> 06:02.260
Good day, Mr. Shao.

06:02.620 --> 06:04.746
Chairman Su, have a seat.

06:04.770 --> 06:06.220
Thank you, Mr. Shao.

06:24.740 --> 06:28.360
[Liansheng House]

07:01.100 --> 07:02.550
Yanan.

07:07.000 --> 07:08.166
What are you doing here?

07:08.190 --> 07:09.516
I'm glad you're back.

07:09.540 --> 07:11.020
I'm going to bed now.

07:12.390 --> 07:13.840
Were you waiting for me?

07:17.140 --> 07:19.870
Right. Sit with me for a bit.

07:27.590 --> 07:28.976
Where have you been?

07:29.000 --> 07:30.450
All night again.

07:31.100 --> 07:32.900
Stopping Kang Qiao from breaking into the jail.

07:33.740 --> 07:35.486
If he really offends the government,

07:35.510 --> 07:38.810
Mr. Mo will be in great danger this time.

07:39.990 --> 07:41.176
What about you?

07:41.200 --> 07:43.110
You didn't come back yesterday.

07:44.190 --> 07:45.756
I left Liansheng House

07:45.780 --> 07:47.450
and went to see Kang Qiao.

07:47.520 --> 07:49.920
I thought if I could make him stay put,

07:50.030 --> 07:52.530
you'd have more time to come up with a solution.

07:53.780 --> 07:56.220
I looked for him till the small hours, but to no avail.

07:56.850 --> 07:58.300
When I came back,

07:58.470 --> 08:00.410
Menglan told me you had gone out.

08:02.050 --> 08:03.286
It's humid at night.

08:03.310 --> 08:05.260
Why did you wait for me outside?

08:08.130 --> 08:10.146
I just want to be with you for a bit longer

08:10.170 --> 08:11.910
while it's quiet.

08:15.580 --> 08:17.030
Me too.

08:18.060 --> 08:19.560
I'm exhausted,

08:20.230 --> 08:21.680
but I have you.

08:31.880 --> 08:34.199
Is it an alliance

08:34.350 --> 08:36.569
or is it love?

08:37.780 --> 08:39.430
I'm not sure.

08:40.210 --> 08:42.790
So that's why she forbids me to do anything to him.

08:43.199 --> 08:44.970
This sister of mine...

08:46.390 --> 08:49.020
What a disgrace to the family.

08:58.710 --> 09:00.300
Is the Su family really responsible

09:00.580 --> 09:02.620
for what happened in Luo family's village?

09:03.540 --> 09:05.410
Although there is no concrete evidence,

09:06.550 --> 09:08.810
they did gain the most.

09:09.440 --> 09:11.006
They were definitely involved.

09:11.030 --> 09:13.440
Su Huairou left Nandu in the middle of the night.

09:13.970 --> 09:16.240
Doesn't that make them seem even more suspicious?

09:16.510 --> 09:17.960
You are wrong.

09:18.950 --> 09:21.750
It's actually a clever move.

09:23.230 --> 09:26.620
She knows the Su family can't escape this disaster,

09:26.880 --> 09:29.566
and a direct confrontation with me

09:29.590 --> 09:32.936
would be mutually destructive at best.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.590
So she chose to leave,

09:34.590 --> 09:36.480
with barely any money on her.

09:36.560 --> 09:38.026
It might seem that she left the Su family's property

09:38.050 --> 09:39.406
to Su Mingyu,

09:39.430 --> 09:42.330
but in fact, she left it to me.

09:42.810 --> 09:44.260
On one hand,

09:44.330 --> 09:45.166
she already knew

09:45.190 --> 09:47.466
my real purpose in supporting the Su family.

09:47.490 --> 09:50.206
On the other hand, she was sure that

09:50.230 --> 09:53.146
I wouldn't destroy what's an important source of support

09:53.170 --> 09:54.640
for me in Nandu.

09:56.140 --> 09:57.670
Retreat in order to advance.

09:58.000 --> 09:59.600
Your stock-in-trade.

10:04.230 --> 10:06.930
I lost this round.

10:08.740 --> 10:10.230
But it's OK.

10:11.360 --> 10:14.280
Let bygones be bygones.

10:16.630 --> 10:18.080
You've changed.

10:18.800 --> 10:20.690
You used to be so stubborn

10:20.780 --> 10:22.380
and couldn't let go of anything.

10:24.480 --> 10:26.790
Things are different now.

10:29.260 --> 10:30.810
I have you now.

10:46.110 --> 10:48.170
If the Su family didn't do it,

10:49.280 --> 10:51.060
would you have any other clues?

10:58.780 --> 11:00.350
You've been too tired lately.

11:00.750 --> 11:02.200
Have a good sleep.

11:22.030 --> 11:23.510
Don't touch him.

11:23.690 --> 11:25.540
For the benefit of the sect, too,

11:25.740 --> 11:27.456
Xiang must live.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.356
He's a member of Yuntai.

11:28.380 --> 11:30.636
What's he got to do with the benefit of Lingyuan?

11:30.660 --> 11:32.296
I'd like to know the details.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.586
At first I thought

11:33.610 --> 11:35.046
Xiang was just investigating

11:35.070 --> 11:36.736
Wen Cong's case.

11:36.760 --> 11:38.670
So I approached him

11:38.740 --> 11:41.516
and secretly helped him search for clues,

11:41.540 --> 11:43.896
taking the opportunity to get rid of Ye Xiao's henchmen.

11:43.920 --> 11:45.276
Later I found out

11:45.300 --> 11:47.516
that Xiang came to Nandu for something else.

11:47.540 --> 11:49.140
He is seeking revenge.

11:49.200 --> 11:51.036
And I know exactly how

11:51.060 --> 11:53.950
to make Nangong Fang his target.

11:54.860 --> 11:56.340
You just need to remember

11:56.910 --> 11:58.590
that you mustn't touch him.

12:08.740 --> 12:10.330
Why is it

12:12.380 --> 12:14.260
that you look worried these days?

12:21.090 --> 12:22.726
Only when you've settled down

12:22.750 --> 12:24.220
can I be at ease.

12:27.440 --> 12:28.890
Go to sleep.

12:35.560 --> 12:37.010
Don't go.

12:37.160 --> 12:39.200
Stay until I'm asleep, OK?

12:40.950 --> 12:42.400
OK.

13:06.440 --> 13:10.800
[Shao's Study]

13:21.120 --> 13:22.716
With so much work to do every day,

13:22.740 --> 13:24.190
you must be very tired.

13:25.380 --> 13:28.650
What brings you here today, Mr. Su?

13:29.350 --> 13:31.430
There is indeed something personal.

13:31.890 --> 13:34.676
Well... I was wondering

13:34.700 --> 13:37.516
if this painting is Hanshan and Shide

13:37.540 --> 13:39.410
by Mr. Feng Qiu.

13:40.990 --> 13:43.076
You know this painting?

13:43.100 --> 13:44.426
Actually,

13:44.450 --> 13:45.616
I have an old friend

13:45.640 --> 13:48.430
who loves this painting very much.

13:48.730 --> 13:50.860
He looked for it for years

13:50.990 --> 13:51.750
before finding out

13:51.750 --> 13:54.460
that it's kept in your residence.

13:54.740 --> 13:56.396
He dare not come to ask,

13:56.420 --> 13:58.436
so he turned to me for help.

13:58.460 --> 14:02.196
Your friend has good taste.

14:02.220 --> 14:03.356
Yes.

14:03.380 --> 14:05.830
This painting is exquisite in brushwork,

14:05.900 --> 14:07.440
and vivid in depiction.

14:07.810 --> 14:10.310
It's a real treasure

14:10.960 --> 14:12.440
of immense value.

14:15.540 --> 14:19.630
I happen to have a banknote of 10,000 taels of silver on me

14:20.390 --> 14:23.530
and wish to place a deposit on this masterpiece.

14:23.820 --> 14:26.940
It's just that my friend is not in Nandu,

14:27.430 --> 14:29.060
and I don't know

14:29.440 --> 14:31.050
when he will be back.

14:36.450 --> 14:39.850
Sounds like a kindred spirit that's hard to find.

14:40.830 --> 14:42.410
When he comes back,

14:42.540 --> 14:44.596
I'll be happy to have him over.

14:44.620 --> 14:46.650
Thank you for your generosity.

14:48.900 --> 14:51.440
That was a personal matter.

14:51.850 --> 14:54.206
There is also a public one,

14:54.230 --> 14:57.406
and I was hoping you could kindly give me some advice.

14:57.430 --> 14:59.766
If it's about Mo Bufan,

14:59.790 --> 15:01.380
there's no need to mention it.

15:04.870 --> 15:07.030
As the new chairman of the Chamber of Commerce,

15:07.380 --> 15:08.980
I'm keen to do something,

15:09.130 --> 15:11.930
as well as help lighten your burden.

15:13.390 --> 15:15.680
Lighten my burden?

15:15.870 --> 15:17.276
Yes.

15:17.300 --> 15:19.400
I heard a few days ago

15:19.600 --> 15:22.430
that the Treasury had lost 100,000 taels of silver,

15:22.640 --> 15:24.846
and there were only about 70,000 taels found

15:24.870 --> 15:26.490
in Guanghui Bank.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.726
The capital

15:27.750 --> 15:29.250
is expecting to receive tributary silver

15:29.250 --> 15:31.380
and cloth from Nandu in a few days,

15:32.100 --> 15:34.516
but the rest of the lost silver is not yet found.

15:34.540 --> 15:38.020
You must be worried too.

15:41.290 --> 15:43.286
I'm willing to make up for the rest of the lost silver

15:43.310 --> 15:45.070
for you.

15:47.460 --> 15:51.190
But... even if I make up for it,

15:51.570 --> 15:53.100
you can't close the case.

15:53.590 --> 15:54.856
Mo Bufan keeps saying

15:54.880 --> 15:57.460
that Tang Xiao framed him.

15:57.820 --> 15:59.186
But Tang Xiao

15:59.210 --> 16:01.390
was never able to come and confront him.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.670
I'm not sure what to do.

16:05.400 --> 16:06.850
How about this?

16:06.930 --> 16:10.086
I'll send people to catch the real burglar.

16:10.110 --> 16:13.736
This way Mo Bufan will prove his innocence,

16:13.760 --> 16:16.536
and Tang Xiao won't have to get involved.

16:16.560 --> 16:19.210
Then you can make up for the lost silver,

16:19.740 --> 16:22.940
and the case will be closed.

16:24.650 --> 16:27.160
Thank you so much for your help.

16:28.380 --> 16:31.046
Hang in there. We're almost there.

16:31.070 --> 16:32.166
Almost there.

16:32.190 --> 16:33.376
How much did it cost?

16:33.400 --> 16:34.366
What did you say?

16:34.390 --> 16:36.706
How much did it cost to get me out of the hands

16:36.730 --> 16:38.900
of that corrupt official?

16:39.950 --> 16:40.366
Gently!

16:40.390 --> 16:41.366
Be careful.

16:41.390 --> 16:42.166
Be careful.

16:42.190 --> 16:43.640
Be careful.

16:44.750 --> 16:46.596
Just tell me.

16:46.620 --> 16:48.970
How much did it cost?

16:50.780 --> 16:51.876
Thirty-five thousand taels.

16:51.900 --> 16:53.350
Thirty...

16:55.260 --> 16:58.560
Thirty-five... thousand taels?

16:58.740 --> 17:01.260
Why didn't you just let him kill me?

17:01.800 --> 17:03.446
Mr. Mo must have lost his head in pain.

17:03.470 --> 17:05.129
Please don't take offense.

17:07.350 --> 17:09.546
Guanghui Bank lost a lot this time.

17:09.570 --> 17:12.316
I have paid the 35,000 taels for you, as a loan.

17:12.340 --> 17:13.205
Mr. Mo,

17:13.229 --> 17:14.725
I'll give you 6 months to pay it back.

17:14.749 --> 17:16.076
You can take your time.

17:16.100 --> 17:17.550
It's interest-free.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.330
Fine.

17:23.090 --> 17:24.639
Mr. Su,

17:24.700 --> 17:26.950
I have two favors to ask.

17:27.270 --> 17:28.476
Go ahead, Mr. Mo.

17:28.500 --> 17:30.070
First,

17:30.770 --> 17:32.740
please thank Chairman Su for me.

17:34.400 --> 17:36.360
Second,

17:36.750 --> 17:38.200
tell Yun Xiang...

17:40.590 --> 17:41.766
Tell Yun Xiang...

17:41.790 --> 17:43.526
Tell Yun Xiang to come and see me!

17:43.550 --> 17:44.606
Uncle,

17:44.630 --> 17:46.550
Mr. Su has taken over the position of chairman.

17:46.570 --> 17:48.020
What?

17:49.590 --> 17:50.866
Mr. Mo,

17:50.890 --> 17:52.850
I'll inform Mr. Yun when I get back.

17:53.470 --> 17:55.110
You should rest well.

17:58.670 --> 17:59.526
Uncle.

17:59.550 --> 18:01.346
Are you alright?

18:01.370 --> 18:02.186
Tell me what happened

18:02.210 --> 18:03.850
while I was away.

18:11.290 --> 18:14.460
[Liansheng House]

18:12.650 --> 18:14.100
Right.

18:14.870 --> 18:15.676
Here we are.

18:15.700 --> 18:17.526
You've been laughing all the way,

18:17.550 --> 18:19.346
but you don't seem tired at all.

18:19.370 --> 18:21.270
Let's get out now.

18:21.430 --> 18:22.880
Let's go.

18:26.110 --> 18:27.560
Come here.

18:41.670 --> 18:43.120
Come on out.

18:44.260 --> 18:46.250
Call me "boss."

18:47.280 --> 18:48.406
Listen,

18:48.430 --> 18:49.626
we're in our own place now.

18:49.650 --> 18:50.886
Once you guys have settled in,

18:50.910 --> 18:52.800
we'll treat you to steamed buns.

18:54.940 --> 18:57.140
Call me "boss" and I'll get out.

18:59.570 --> 19:01.020
Jiabao.

19:04.470 --> 19:06.560
I only listen to Tianhu.

19:07.740 --> 19:09.736
Looks like I've got an admirer,

19:09.760 --> 19:11.210
right?

19:11.440 --> 19:12.446
Brat.

19:12.470 --> 19:13.920
Let's go.

19:17.580 --> 19:19.640
Dealing with the government

19:20.270 --> 19:22.700
is more tiring than fighting with the robbers.

19:23.100 --> 19:24.910
You have to weigh your words

19:25.380 --> 19:28.870
while trying to figure out what he really means

19:29.130 --> 19:30.720
by his words.

19:32.380 --> 19:35.340
You also have to find a way to be polite

19:36.440 --> 19:38.400
which doesn't disgust yourself.

19:38.590 --> 19:40.756
That's how the government is.

19:40.780 --> 19:42.880
It's really hard to make them

19:42.960 --> 19:44.560
release someone.

19:45.570 --> 19:47.790
You did very well this time.

19:47.950 --> 19:50.110
I'm only realizing now

19:50.850 --> 19:53.020
how hard it was for my sister.

19:54.130 --> 19:55.616
I was only dealing with Magistrate Shao,

19:55.640 --> 19:57.550
and I'm exhausted.

19:58.530 --> 20:00.890
My sister had to deal with so many departments

20:02.070 --> 20:05.350
for the prosperity of the family.

20:06.310 --> 20:08.580
All those offices,

20:08.980 --> 20:10.856
and all those officials,

20:10.880 --> 20:13.210
she had to attend to every one of them.

20:15.780 --> 20:17.230
Mingyu,

20:17.460 --> 20:18.896
these things

20:18.920 --> 20:21.160
must have made you feel out of your depth.

20:22.750 --> 20:23.390
But you've been

20:23.390 --> 20:26.070
exposed to business strategies since you were little,

20:26.500 --> 20:29.810
and you know how to deal with the government.

20:30.660 --> 20:33.180
You really did very well this time.

20:34.680 --> 20:37.026
Don't worry. I'll be with you.

20:37.050 --> 20:39.660
Let's take our time, OK?

20:48.910 --> 20:50.236
How is Mr. Mo?

20:50.260 --> 20:51.296
He's OK,

20:51.320 --> 20:52.676
but was injured here.

20:52.700 --> 20:54.150
He can only lie on his stomach.

20:56.270 --> 20:57.720
Mr. Yun,

20:59.580 --> 21:02.360
I've informed Mr. Mo of what happened in the past few days.

21:02.640 --> 21:04.090
But...

21:04.260 --> 21:07.110
But not your plan to break into the jail?

21:08.430 --> 21:09.686
It's in the past now.

21:09.710 --> 21:11.160
No need to mention it.

21:12.260 --> 21:13.710
Thank you.

21:21.960 --> 21:24.216
Didn't I tell you

21:24.240 --> 21:25.676
to keep a low profile?

21:25.700 --> 21:26.766
But you're

21:26.790 --> 21:28.386
causing trouble everywhere!

21:28.410 --> 21:30.450
Calm down. Lie still.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.966
This pain is nothing

21:31.990 --> 21:34.086
compared to my heartache.

21:34.110 --> 21:36.396
You had a great fight with Tang Xiao,

21:36.420 --> 21:40.286
but I lost over 100,000 taels of silver!

21:40.310 --> 21:41.326
Mr. Mo,

21:41.350 --> 21:42.806
you've suffered a lot this time.

21:42.830 --> 21:45.116
But since we're both serving the sect...

21:45.140 --> 21:46.590
Stop.

21:46.670 --> 21:48.106
"Serving the sect"?

21:48.130 --> 21:50.580
How do you even have the gall to say that?

21:51.030 --> 21:53.206
Kang Qiao, go ahead

21:53.230 --> 21:54.726
and get some paper and a writing brush.

21:54.750 --> 21:56.106
I'll let Master decide

21:56.130 --> 21:58.286
if he's turning Nandu upside down

21:58.310 --> 22:00.890
for the sect or for himself!

22:03.180 --> 22:04.760
Go!

22:07.350 --> 22:08.800
Mr. Mo.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.090
Calm down.

22:11.140 --> 22:12.870
I do think it's time now

22:13.300 --> 22:16.520
to report everything to Master.

22:18.670 --> 22:19.776
What are you up to now?

22:19.800 --> 22:21.006
I have learned from Su Huairou

22:21.030 --> 22:22.696
the truth about the east-coast

22:22.720 --> 22:24.686
land purchase case 15 years ago.

22:24.710 --> 22:26.096
According to her,

22:26.120 --> 22:28.486
it was a member of the Lingyuan Sect

22:28.510 --> 22:30.280
who plotted it for Su Linghe.

22:32.180 --> 22:34.970
She was just afraid that you would retaliate against her,

22:35.000 --> 22:35.896
so she made a scapegoat

22:35.920 --> 22:38.190
of someone you can't mess with.

22:39.210 --> 22:40.660
Maybe...

22:40.920 --> 22:41.996
Or maybe not.

22:42.020 --> 22:44.056
Lingyuan used to use force to create chaos,

22:44.080 --> 22:45.560
but they have frequently intervened

22:45.560 --> 22:47.566
in business affairs in recent years.

22:47.590 --> 22:50.040
Have you ever thought that maybe they have changed?

22:50.300 --> 22:51.716
And maybe they had already changed

22:51.740 --> 22:53.490
fifteen years ago?

22:53.770 --> 22:54.996
Yuntai and Lingyuan

22:55.020 --> 22:56.940
have been fighting for over a century.

22:57.070 --> 22:59.300
If some of the Lingyuan people got smart

22:59.340 --> 23:01.596
and started to imitate us,

23:01.620 --> 23:03.190
I wouldn't be surprised.

23:04.110 --> 23:05.386
If that's the case,

23:05.410 --> 23:07.516
the sect should have noticed it.

23:07.540 --> 23:08.716
Indeed.

23:08.740 --> 23:10.750
That's what confuses me.

23:11.180 --> 23:12.646
We'll keep it to ourselves for now.

23:12.670 --> 23:14.300
Don't report it to Master.

23:15.110 --> 23:16.466
Mr. Mo,

23:16.490 --> 23:18.236
from Tang Xiao's death

23:18.260 --> 23:20.680
to you being framed in the Treasury burglary case,

23:20.880 --> 23:23.180
Lingyuan must have been behind all this.

23:24.050 --> 23:26.346
It's their blatant provocation.

23:26.370 --> 23:27.936
We will have to fight them,

23:27.960 --> 23:29.396
so why not get prepared in advance?

23:29.420 --> 23:30.696
Do as I said.

23:30.720 --> 23:34.140
I'll explain it to you in due course.

23:35.580 --> 23:37.890
This small Guanghui Bank of mine

23:38.150 --> 23:41.210
was only in charge of passing on information for the sect.

23:41.580 --> 23:44.370
I didn't want to be involved in anything else.

23:45.420 --> 23:47.980
But now they are messing with me

23:48.030 --> 23:50.040
and getting their hands on my money.

23:50.470 --> 23:51.920
Fine.

23:52.270 --> 23:54.940
Since they have dared to play with fire,

23:55.380 --> 23:59.060
I'll be sure to teach them a lesson.

24:10.310 --> 24:13.070
[Ling Yan, Lingyuan Sect]

24:18.110 --> 24:18.946
Sir,

24:18.970 --> 24:21.190
it's an urgent message from Mr. Ye of Nandu.

24:22.310 --> 24:24.806
Young Master stole from the Treasury and framed Yuntai.

24:24.830 --> 24:26.426
Mr. Ye is afraid that things might get out of control

24:26.450 --> 24:27.626
and seeks your advice.

24:27.650 --> 24:30.750
He stole from the Treasury and framed Yuntai?

24:31.420 --> 24:34.276
Young Master is getting better and better

24:34.300 --> 24:36.320
at kissing the child for the nurse's sake.

24:37.590 --> 24:39.040
My reply is

24:39.270 --> 24:40.820
"It's OK."

24:47.150 --> 24:48.156
Captain,

24:48.180 --> 24:49.670
Mr. Nangong has replied.

24:51.340 --> 24:54.460
[It's OK.]

24:56.460 --> 24:57.786
"It's OK"?

24:57.810 --> 24:59.556
Does he mean there's no need to interfere?

24:59.580 --> 25:00.876
By these few words

25:00.900 --> 25:03.450
he means we shouldn't bother him with such trivial matters,

25:03.630 --> 25:05.540
but should make our own decision.

25:08.110 --> 25:10.190
Young Master came to Nandu.

25:11.440 --> 25:14.470
It will be my fault if things go wrong.

25:15.400 --> 25:16.406
Captain,

25:16.430 --> 25:18.466
Young Master has left through the west gate with his bodyguard.

25:18.490 --> 25:19.666
They're carrying luggage

25:19.690 --> 25:20.926
and probably going on a long trip.

25:20.950 --> 25:22.016
Are you sure?

25:22.040 --> 25:23.226
Yes.

25:23.250 --> 25:23.866
Let's go.

25:23.890 --> 25:25.950
I'll watch him cross the river.

25:26.610 --> 25:32.480
[The day of tributary silver's departure for the capital]

25:33.150 --> 25:35.230
Make sure you check every box.

25:35.390 --> 25:37.910
We must depart on time.

26:05.050 --> 26:06.850
What a nuisance!

26:18.400 --> 26:20.610
Young Master, why did you leave without saying goodbye?

26:21.070 --> 26:22.786
If I had known you were leaving,

26:22.810 --> 26:25.470
I would have held a farewell banquet for you.

26:26.550 --> 26:28.000
Sit.

26:33.490 --> 26:37.240
So the government just released Mo Bufan like that?

26:37.370 --> 26:39.210
I heard that

26:39.260 --> 26:41.120
the Su family interceded for him

26:41.170 --> 26:42.716
and spent tens of thousands of taels of silver

26:42.740 --> 26:45.360
to get Mo Bufan out of the jail.

26:46.070 --> 26:47.070
But Mo Bufan

26:47.070 --> 26:48.950
did suffer a lot in there.

26:49.030 --> 26:52.970
Young Master, you've at least given him a warning.

26:53.650 --> 26:57.440
The Su family is the leading merchant in Nandu.

26:57.730 --> 27:00.410
Now they are so close to Mr. Xiang.

27:00.740 --> 27:02.350
Looks like Yuntai has established

27:02.350 --> 27:04.340
a solid foundation in Nandu.

27:05.070 --> 27:06.166
It's OK.

27:06.190 --> 27:07.650
It surely is.

27:09.060 --> 27:12.216
Isn't Mr. Nangong setting things up?

27:12.240 --> 27:13.960
We'll subdue them sooner or later.

27:14.100 --> 27:15.550
Young Master,

27:15.740 --> 27:17.326
it was us who were appointed

27:17.350 --> 27:19.430
by Master to manage the commerce in Jiangnan.

27:28.470 --> 27:29.920
All set?

27:34.390 --> 27:35.840
Mr. Ye,

27:36.600 --> 27:38.446
there's no point in discussing these things.

27:38.470 --> 27:39.496
Every August,

27:39.520 --> 27:41.726
tributary silver from Nandu goes up north along the canal.

27:41.750 --> 27:44.216
If you're here to bid me farewell,

27:44.240 --> 27:46.780
why don't you watch us fight a battle?

28:07.140 --> 28:09.196
Why did you kill the messenger?

28:09.220 --> 28:10.670
Mr. Ye,

28:10.960 --> 28:13.400
those tricks that Mr. Nangong copied from Yuntai

28:13.420 --> 28:15.570
are really very clumsy.

28:15.680 --> 28:19.710
Lingyuan should have our own way.

28:19.800 --> 28:22.136
I'll give Mr. Nangong a surprise.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.610
So long!

28:30.390 --> 28:32.550
Captain, do we follow him now?

28:32.870 --> 28:34.320
Forget it.

28:34.450 --> 28:37.120
He's determined to defeat me.

28:38.280 --> 28:45.910
[A relay station's dock on the canal]

28:57.080 --> 28:59.860
I can't see anything clearly in this fog.

29:01.590 --> 29:04.720
You get the same weather on this day every year.

29:05.670 --> 29:07.876
Nandu's warrant has already arrived.

29:07.900 --> 29:09.350
Just hang in there.

29:09.630 --> 29:11.750
It's going to be over after tonight.

29:11.790 --> 29:12.896
Although the warrant is here,

29:12.920 --> 29:15.460
no one has told us when the ship will depart.

29:16.110 --> 29:17.916
I wonder where the hell the messenger is.

29:17.940 --> 29:19.566
It's getting late,

29:19.590 --> 29:21.690
but there's no sign of the ships.

29:22.410 --> 29:23.980
What are you afraid of?

29:24.220 --> 29:26.180
We're in a time of peace and plenty,

29:26.440 --> 29:29.330
and not in the past, when there were pirates.

29:58.840 --> 30:00.366
Where did the boat come from?

30:00.390 --> 30:01.816
There're no lights on it.

30:01.840 --> 30:02.886
Wait.

30:02.910 --> 30:04.950
It's an official boat for transporting tributary silver.

30:16.310 --> 30:18.596
The house stood empty for many years.

30:18.620 --> 30:20.300
I hope you don't mind.

30:21.890 --> 30:25.040
If we can modify the layout of the courtyard,

30:25.420 --> 30:27.630
this will be a perfect place for a foundling home.

30:27.700 --> 30:31.120
To let such a big house stand empty...

30:33.500 --> 30:35.530
Rich people like you...

30:36.420 --> 30:38.196
Jin likes to joke.

30:38.220 --> 30:40.210
You should be thankful to Mr. Su.

30:40.970 --> 30:42.286
I found mugworts here.

30:42.310 --> 30:43.366
One bunch for each of you.

30:43.390 --> 30:44.046
Thank you, chap.

30:44.070 --> 30:46.270
My father said they can repel mosquitoes and evil spirits.

30:49.750 --> 30:51.200
Boss?

30:52.270 --> 30:53.890
Crouch down!

30:56.820 --> 30:57.966
Since you need to hold a sword,

30:57.990 --> 30:59.590
it's more convenient this way.

31:00.310 --> 31:01.960
Let's see if I can catch you!

31:02.850 --> 31:04.300
I'll catch you!

31:06.150 --> 31:07.600
Jin,

31:08.390 --> 31:11.660
he seems to be a special one.

31:11.820 --> 31:13.700
Is he from Jishan Hall as well?

31:15.590 --> 31:17.756
Once, I was besieged by my enemies

31:17.780 --> 31:19.230
and was seriously injured.

31:19.590 --> 31:21.006
His father saved me.

31:21.030 --> 31:22.710
Later, his father went out to battle.

31:22.750 --> 31:24.580
I haven't heard from him for years.

31:25.720 --> 31:28.340
Jiabao has stayed at many foundling homes.

31:28.430 --> 31:29.990
It's all thanks to you

31:31.190 --> 31:32.640
that we found him this time.

31:33.740 --> 31:35.500
It was the least I could do.

31:42.470 --> 31:44.460
I haven't seen him for years.

31:45.180 --> 31:47.260
He looks exactly like his father.

31:48.170 --> 31:50.850
I had never looked up to anyone in my life

31:51.090 --> 31:53.960
until I met his father.

31:54.830 --> 31:56.166
That explains it.

31:56.190 --> 31:57.446
Jin even gets scared

31:57.470 --> 31:59.290
when Jiabao stares at him.

32:02.310 --> 32:04.086
I'm not good with words of gratitude.

32:04.110 --> 32:06.076
If there're things I can help with

32:06.100 --> 32:07.850
at the Chamber of Commerce,

32:08.490 --> 32:09.806
just let me know.

32:09.830 --> 32:12.426
Hopefully there won't be any.

32:12.450 --> 32:16.020
It will save all of us trouble.

32:25.680 --> 32:26.746
Boss,

32:26.770 --> 32:28.730
what would you like for dinner?

32:28.950 --> 32:32.036
I want to have steamed pork buns made by Tianhu!

32:32.060 --> 32:32.856
Yes!

32:32.880 --> 32:34.536
Steamed pork buns made by Tianhu!

32:34.560 --> 32:36.240
No problem. We'll make them when we get back.

32:36.260 --> 32:38.100
You're going to help me.

32:39.000 --> 32:40.246
Come and have a look.

32:40.270 --> 32:41.056
I like this.

32:41.080 --> 32:42.530
This one?

32:44.790 --> 32:46.016
I want this one.

32:46.040 --> 32:47.246
This one looks good too.

32:47.270 --> 32:48.006
They're all pretty.

32:48.030 --> 32:49.480
I like this one.

32:50.680 --> 32:52.130
Jin,

32:52.390 --> 32:54.156
tell all your friends,

32:54.180 --> 32:55.326
orphans

32:55.350 --> 32:57.236
and unattended children are all welcome here.

32:57.260 --> 32:58.716
We'll sponsor it.

32:58.740 --> 33:01.060
They can stay here for the next few years.

33:01.190 --> 33:03.960
We'll figure something out when they grow up.

33:08.870 --> 33:11.446
We need to find kind and patient people

33:11.470 --> 33:13.390
to be in charge of their future education.

33:13.870 --> 33:16.200
Sure, as long as it's good for the kids.

33:18.440 --> 33:20.520
Out the way!

33:22.110 --> 33:24.256
Out of the way! Emergency order from the government!

33:24.280 --> 33:25.846
Emergency order from the government!

33:25.870 --> 33:27.320
Out the way!

33:30.140 --> 33:33.166
Emergency order from Nandu and Jiangnan Government Offices

33:33.190 --> 33:35.600
to close markets and borders!

33:36.220 --> 33:37.670
Close borders?

33:48.310 --> 33:51.160
[Qing'an Gate]

33:59.320 --> 34:01.510
Why did they close the gate in the middle of the day?

34:02.110 --> 34:03.560
Waiter.

34:04.730 --> 34:05.606
Coming!

34:05.630 --> 34:07.216
What's going on?

34:07.240 --> 34:09.376
Why is the gate closed in the middle of the day?

34:09.400 --> 34:11.826
I don't know exactly.

34:11.850 --> 34:13.306
There're all kinds of rumors.

34:13.330 --> 34:16.926
Anyway, it's the same in all of the towns around here.

34:16.950 --> 34:19.246
The city opens at 5 a.m. and closes at 7 p.m.

34:19.270 --> 34:20.720
according to the law.

34:20.910 --> 34:23.855
There should be a reason for closing the city during the day.

34:23.879 --> 34:25.329
A reason?

34:25.450 --> 34:27.085
I really don't know.

34:27.109 --> 34:29.085
Maybe you could try

34:29.109 --> 34:30.666
and listen to those guys over there.

34:30.690 --> 34:31.886
The official silver

34:31.910 --> 34:34.236
was lost and then found half a month ago.

34:34.260 --> 34:35.876
But then they lost it again.

34:35.900 --> 34:37.650
It's so strange.

34:38.750 --> 34:40.976
You really don't know what it was?

34:41.000 --> 34:42.525
No, what was it?

34:42.549 --> 34:44.286
It was the water ghost!

34:44.310 --> 34:45.926
Water ghost?

34:45.950 --> 34:49.166
The water ghost used a trick called "Five Ghosts Moving Mountains"

34:49.190 --> 34:50.795
to rob the government's treasury.

34:50.819 --> 34:52.950
Mr. Shao had to ask a Taoist priest

34:52.970 --> 34:54.466
to suppress it with the official seal

34:54.490 --> 34:56.966
and got the money back.

34:56.990 --> 34:57.886
So what's this now?

34:57.910 --> 35:00.190
The water ghost has done it again?

35:00.460 --> 35:03.016
It's said that a fisherman saw a water ghost

35:03.040 --> 35:04.776
get on a boat

35:04.800 --> 35:07.286
and eat all the soldiers last night.

35:07.310 --> 35:09.196
Really? That's so creepy!

35:09.220 --> 35:10.190
Yeah, exactly.

35:10.210 --> 35:11.780
If so,

35:11.970 --> 35:15.456
why don't they just ask that Taoist priest

35:15.480 --> 35:17.376
to help get the money back again?

35:17.400 --> 35:19.546
Why are they making such a fuss?

35:19.570 --> 35:21.196
Is it that the water ghost might run away

35:21.220 --> 35:23.180
or that the Taoist priest might go on retreat?

35:24.220 --> 35:25.566
What do you know?

35:25.590 --> 35:26.936
If it's not the water ghost,

35:26.960 --> 35:29.846
then how did all the money disappear?

35:29.870 --> 35:30.866
-Yeah. -Exactly.

35:30.890 --> 35:32.396
Arrest them all!

35:32.420 --> 35:33.870
Yes, sir!

35:34.180 --> 35:34.940
Spreading rumors.

35:34.940 --> 35:36.486
This guy, this, this and that one.

35:36.510 --> 35:37.676
Arrest them all!

35:37.700 --> 35:39.150
Stop!

35:40.470 --> 35:41.546
Don't move!

35:41.570 --> 35:43.020
What?

35:44.750 --> 35:46.056
Despite such a serious case,

35:46.080 --> 35:47.020
you're arresting people for no reason

35:47.020 --> 35:48.600
instead of soothing them.

35:48.870 --> 35:50.206
What reason is there?

35:50.230 --> 35:51.326
Reason?

35:51.350 --> 35:54.266
I am the reason!

35:54.290 --> 35:55.136
Guards!

35:55.160 --> 35:57.270
Arrest all three of them!

35:57.360 --> 35:58.846
W-What are you doing?

35:58.870 --> 35:59.736
How dare you!

35:59.760 --> 36:01.480
I'm warning you!

36:02.640 --> 36:04.676
[Commanding Officer, Beidu Dept. of Imperial Security]

36:04.700 --> 36:07.700
[Li Bo, Sheriff of Beidu Dept. of Imperial Security]

36:09.760 --> 36:11.210
Please, sir...

36:12.230 --> 36:13.680
I'm Liu Gongquan.

36:13.250 --> 36:18.330
[Liu Gongquan, Commanding Officer of Beidu Dept. of Imperial Security]

36:14.230 --> 36:15.680
Nice to meet you.

36:16.080 --> 36:17.580
The renowned imperial guard of Jiangnan?

36:18.010 --> 36:20.650
Mr. Liu, nice to meet you.

36:20.860 --> 36:22.986
The government offices of Nandu and Jiangnan

36:23.010 --> 36:24.266
issued an urgent order.

36:24.290 --> 36:26.620
I'm just following that.

36:26.950 --> 36:28.400
Imperial guards...

36:28.510 --> 36:30.440
Imperial guards are not allowed to interfere either.

36:36.480 --> 36:37.930
Uncle,

36:38.750 --> 36:40.920
looks like your prestige is not very helpful.

36:45.510 --> 36:47.230
If being an imperial guard is not enough,

36:48.310 --> 36:49.900
what about being a princess?

36:50.480 --> 36:52.236
How dare you draw your sword at me?

36:51.890 --> 36:56.100
[Princess Mingzhu]

36:52.260 --> 36:54.180
Do you have some kind of death wish?

36:54.460 --> 36:55.156
Your Highness.

36:55.180 --> 36:55.956
On your knees now!

36:55.980 --> 36:57.416
Your Highness!

36:57.440 --> 36:58.396
I'm terribly sorry

36:58.420 --> 36:59.616
to have offended you.

36:59.640 --> 37:01.176
I'm terribly sorry.

37:01.200 --> 37:02.650
I'm sorry.

37:06.750 --> 37:09.420
[Liansheng House]

37:07.510 --> 37:09.110
Goodbye, sir.

37:10.030 --> 37:11.126
Sorry, sir.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.406
Please come back later.

37:12.430 --> 37:14.326
You're asked to close so often these days.

37:14.350 --> 37:15.756
I can't even have a good time.

37:15.780 --> 37:16.836
They're strict orders from the government.

37:16.860 --> 37:18.760
We have no choice.

37:22.390 --> 37:24.470
I only heard that 100,000 taels of silver

37:24.470 --> 37:25.846
disappeared during the night.

37:25.870 --> 37:26.950
All counties within a hundred miles

37:26.950 --> 37:29.340
along the canal are closed and strictly guarded.

37:31.590 --> 37:33.310
Do you know the details?

37:33.630 --> 37:35.236
There're all kinds of rumors

37:35.260 --> 37:36.436
which aren't credible.

37:36.460 --> 37:38.750
And the government is keeping quiet.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.896
This is by no means an ordinary case.

37:41.920 --> 37:43.630
Nor is the offender an ordinary person.

37:44.260 --> 37:45.940
Mr. Mo asked me to tell you

37:45.990 --> 37:47.450
not to take it lightly.
